p_tau = mu_K**2*(-N(t) + Derivative(tau(t), t))*a(t)**3/(K*N(t))
dL/dtau = -N(t)*a(t)**3*Derivative(V(tau(t)), tau(t))
KA1a dC/dt - (-N a^3 V'(tau)) = 0
KA1b V = 0: dL/dtau = 0 -> C conserved
rho_K + V (N=1, Q=q) = (2*K*V(tau(t)) + mu_K**2*q**2 - mu_K**2)/(2*K)  (frw_charge.out: mu^2 (q-1)(q+1)/2K, plus V)
p_K + p_V = -V(tau(t)) + mu_K**2*(q - 1)**2/(2*K)  (p_K = mu^2 (q-1)^2/2K, p_V = -V)
KA1c d(a^3 rho)/dt + p d(a^3)/dt on shell = 0
Integration by parts (Q ~ 1, tau = t + tau_i): C_final - C_i = -int a^3 V' dt = int V d(a^3) - [a^3 V]
